OL,3,AUS to allow Iran delegation to attend
OL,4,AUN meetings in New York as war passes
OL,5,Ahalf-year mark
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US government has granted visas to
OL,8,FIranian officials so they can travel to
OL,9,Fthe UN General Assembly in New York
OL,10,Fnext week, as the war between the two
OL,11,Fcountries grinds into its seventh
OL,12,Fmonth.
OL,14,FThe BBC understands the core delegation
OL,15,Fpermitted to attend includes Iranian
OL,16,FPresident Masoud Pezeshkian and Foreign
OL,17,FMinister Abbas Araghchi.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
